construct the operation lookup:

  hold the operation table: HHWXHSUULULH

  hold the noop lookup function: W XE XE XE XEXL H

  { library fork | lookup table }

  define a utility function to add one level to the lookup function:

    (eq: H YXEXHEU SU) X Ht1 (X (X Hn0 Hc) (X (X Ho Hlr) Hl))
    (fork: Y) X Ht (X Ht0 Ht1)
    (fork: Y) X Ht0 (X Ht2 (X Hn (X Hn0 Hn1)))
    WX
      X Ht2 X (X Hor Hcr) X Hn1 Hlr
      X Ht X (X (X Ho Hor) (X Hc Hcr)) X Hn Hl

    t1 n0 c o lr l t t0 t1 t0 t2 n n0 n1 t2 or cr n1 lr t o  or c  cr n  l
    -  -  - - -  - - -  0  1  -  - 3  -  1  -  -  1  8  9 12 4  16 6  12 19
    19: U SUSUSUSUSU SUSUSUSUSU SUSUSUSUSU SUSUSUSU UL HHHHH HHHHH HHHHH HHHH
    12: U SUSUSUSUSU SUSUSUSUSU SUSU                UL HHHHH HHHHH HH
    6:  U SUSUSUSUSU SU                             UL HHHHH H
    16: U SUSUSUSUSU SUSUSUSUSU SUSUSUSUSU SU       UL HHHHH HHHHH HHHHH H
    4:  U SUSUSUSU                                  UL HHHH
