    9:  U SUSUSUSUSU SUSUSUSU                       UL HHHHH HHHH
    8:  U SUSUSUSUSU SUSUSU                         UL HHHHH HHH
    1:  U SU                                        UL H
    1:  U SU                                        UL H
    3:  U SUSUSU                                    UL HHH
    1:  U SU                                        UL H
    0:  U                                           UL

  { library fork util | lookup table }

  repeatedly apply to the hold to obtain all levels:

    YXULH 0
    YXULH 1
    YXULH 2
    YXULH 3
    YXULH 4
    YXULH 5
    YXULH 6
    YXULH 7
    YXULH 8
