    YXULH 12
    YXULH 13
    E

  { library fork | lookup table }

  put the table into the lookup:

    WXSXULXULL

  { library fork lookup | }

{ library fork lookup | boot_fn }

build the engine:

  the engine is a package which operates on the state

  the state consists of the following:

    ((stack hold) ((in out) (library (engine (lookup _)))))

  the engine reads a character, feeds that to lookup the operation, and runs the engine on the resulting state

  hold the lookup: H

  { fork | lookup }

