{ engine | lookup boot_fn }

construct the state:

  { engine | lookup boot_fn }
  WX UL E
  { engine (x lookup e) | boot_fn }
  HYH WX UL UL
  { engine (x engine x lookup e) | boot_fn }
  UXH
  { engine (x engine x lookup e) (x io (x library _)) | boot }
  XHXHE
  { engine (x engine x lookup e) | library io boot }
  HWXUSLUL
  { engine (x library x engine x lookup e) | io boot }
  HWXUSLUL
  { engine (x io x library x engine x lookup e) | boot }
  HWXEUL
  { engine (x e x io x library x engine x lookup e) | boot }

{ engine state | boot }

trigger the engine and pass it the state:

  H X XYHHXSLUUL UL U

{ boot | }

and, finally, bootstrap!

