variables:

  variables will be stored in a dictionary, represented as a function that:
  - takes a trigger and a variable name
  - returns a wire to that variable and an updated dictionary

  first, construct the 'cons' operation on this type of dictionary:

    WX Hc0 X Hn0 X Hv X Hr
    X F Ht0
      F Ht1
      F Ht2
      F X Hc0 X Hc1 Hc2
      F X Hn0 X Hn1 (X Ha Hb)
        X Hm0 X Hm1 (X Hp Hq)
    X Hm0 X Hu
      AAA
        Q Ht0 (Q Ht1 (X Hb Hq) (X (X Ha Hp) (X N0 N1))) X
          HSU
          (X H0v X H0u X H0r (AAAA Hc1 Hc2 Hn1 H0v (AAA H0r Ht2 Hm1 H0u)))
          (X H1v X H1v X H1r H1r)
        Hv Hu Hr

    c0 n0 v r t0 t1 t2 c0 c1 c2 n0 n1 a b m0 m1 p q m0 u t0 t1 b q a p 0v 0u 0r c1 c2 n1 0v 0r t2 m1 0u 1v 1v 1r 1r v  u  r
    -  -  - - -  -  -  0  -  -  1  -  - - -  -  - - 0  - 4  5  4 4 8 7 -  -  -  13 14 14 3  4  24 17 8  -  0  -  0  36 22 39
